WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:04.070
Stand on the blue line right behind you.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.779
Take one step forward…

00:00:06.779 --> 00:00:07.779
Perfect.

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:08.820
That’s great.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:15.110
Brexit is very likely to have a big adverse
economic and political effect on the United

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.160
Kingdom

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:21.830
that would more than offset any long term
gains that they might get from exiting the

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:22.830
union.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:29.160
This is because Brexit would almost certainly
promote a Sterling crisis, since there'd be

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:33.879
a lot of uncertainty in the two years that
Britain would be renegotiating terms with

00:00:33.879 --> 00:00:34.879
Europe

00:00:34.879 --> 00:00:40.420
and that British financial institutions would
be losing their financial passport, and locating

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.180
in Europe.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:48.350
The second reason that it would be bad for
the United Kingdom is that it would very likely

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:53.329
result in a second Scottish referendum on
independence.

00:00:53.329 --> 00:00:59.390
Scotland doesn't want to be part of the United
Kingdom, rather wants to part of Europe

00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:04.890
and that could lead to the dissolution of
the United Kingdom in its present state.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:10.180
And that would be another factor contributing
to economic and political uncertainty.

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:14.690
My view is that Brexit is a bad idea.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:20.580
Please let us know your view in your comments,
and what other topics you'd like us to discuss

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.880
in 60 seconds.

